+that pin api.assps.edu.pk:3016 to 127.0.0.1. ALL other network requests
+were intercepted and blocked. No school cookies/teacher passwords loaded.
+
+Real compiled Chromium QA **8/8 PASS**, repeated:
+1. Unknown-actor dashboard navigates to login, no admin fallback.
+2. Compiled route really redirects rather than displaying protected data.
+3. Nested legacy dashboard avoids administrator next target.
+4. Unauthenticated teacher route requires login.
