+6. Login page loads HTTP200.
+7. No uncaught browser JavaScript faults.
+8. Browser makes actual private requests and blocks all outside origins.
+   Final execution 64 private requests, four off-host requests blocked.
+
+Discovered and FIXED one QA cleanup issue: Next.js forks a child server
+that can outlive the original launcher PID. Updated bash runner starts an
