+  /dashboard/history still biases anonymous login toward admin.
+Login, teacher-specific redirect and anonymous identity refusal PASS.
+
+The public guard always reports authenticatedTeacherAccepted=false,
+independentCrossTenantDenied=false and productionReleaseCertified=false.
+Even 6/6 anonymous pass is NOT a valid authenticated staff/tenant release.
+
+## Genuine production safeguards
